        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hexamethyldisilazane, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hexamethyldisilazane, at plant
The multioutput-process "Chlorosilane amination" delivers the co-products ammonium chloride and hexamethyldisilazane. The allocation is based on stoechiometric calculation.;
UUID: 39f94ac3-4f02-3fbe-8409-8a6e4e0005e4
Chlorosilane amination including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world..
Technology: Amination of chlorosilane
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_39f94ac3-4f02-3fbe-8409-8a6e4e0005e4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
